<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African May tractor sales fall 26 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>S.African May tractor sales fall 26 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African tractor sales were 25.8 percent down on a year ago in May at 498 units and in the year to date sales were down 2.6 percent, the Agricultural Machinery Association said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The association said the disappointing sales followed late rains which delayed summer crop harvesting, adding farmers were uncertain about future price prospects.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
